| 0.A | **Review Key Files & APIs**                    | `[ ]` | **Why:** To understand the current OnePhononTorch implementation and identify modification points. <br> **Files:** `eryx/models_torch.py` (focus on OnePhonon class), `eryx/torch_utils.py` (for tensor utilities). <br> **APIs:** `numpy.loadtxt`, `torch.searchsorted`, `torch.tensor`, PyTorch tensor arithmetic operations.
